// themedMonsterContent returns the abilities and monsters for the pixel-art themes beyond the original
// Forgotten Catacombs roster (which lives in monster_catalog.go). Every monster is declared through
// defineMonster with its art, so a missing or misspelled sprite does not compile.
//
// Numbers are provisional and follow role templates that mirror the catacombs monsters:
//   - striker: 3 damage jab, plus a 5 damage special on every third turn (11 health)
//   - protector: 7 damage heavy blow on odd turns, 4 damage strike otherwise (14 health)
//   - bruiser: interruptible 8 damage crush on even turns, 5 damage strike otherwise (18 health)
//   - disruptor: 4 damage bolt, plus a 2 damage party-wide wail on every third turn (10 health)
//   - support: 3 damage jab, plus a 2 damage party-wide cloud that heals the caster on every third turn (12 health)
//   - boss: one of three 30 health (+4 per depth) rhythms: drain-and-sweep, slam-and-sweep, or relentless
//     with a telegraphed heavy hit every third turn
//
// Simulation must calibrate them before they are used to build real encounters; see
// docs/game-design/monster-content-and-simulation-spike.md.
